# Copy to .env and fill in. VITE_* vars are read at build/dev time. Restart the dev server after edits.
#
# WARNING: Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the PUBLIC JavaScript bundle. Anyone who can load the
# site can read these keys in DevTools. The deployment is behind a team password, which limits WHO can
# reach the bundle but does not hide the key from anyone who gets past it. Use a key with a spend cap,
# and rotate it if it is ever exposed more widely.

# --- OpenAI — the ONLY provider the app calls ---
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
# gpt-4o-mini supports both JSON mode and temperature, which the caller sets. A model that rejects
# either (the o-series reasoning models reject temperature != 1) returns HTTP 400 on every request.
VITE_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# --- Gemini — DISABLED ---
# Gemini is no longer wired into the provider chain (see src/app/lib/ai/ask-browser.ts). Setting
# VITE_AI_PROVIDER or VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY has NO effect; the app calls OpenAI only. Re-enabling is a
# deliberate code change, not a config change.
